            ["Preconstruction", "Medium to high", "Collaborative phase planning, buildability reviews, constraint logs, early contractor involvement", "Contract programme, tender packages"],
            ["Procurement", "Medium", "Kanban for tender packages and submittals, short review cycles with suppliers", "Long-lead order dates, contract terms"],
            ["Construction", "Medium", "Lookahead planning, weekly work plans, daily huddles, visual boards, PPC", "Structure, sequence, safety method statements"],
            ["Fit-out", "Medium to high", "Zone-based takt plans, first-in-place reviews, weekly commitments by trade", "Specification, fire and building regulation requirements"],
